    <briefdescription>
<para>Satisfied when a part of <computeroutput>Expected</computeroutput> is compatible with <computeroutput>Type</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A nested layer of <computeroutput>Expected</computeroutput> (a wrapper) is compatible with <computeroutput>Type</computeroutput>, meaning <computeroutput>Type</computeroutput> can be constructed from an inner layer of <computeroutput>Expected</computeroutput>.</para>
